# Full-audit finding (2026-10-29): session-scratch output that kept reappearing as untracked
# clutter every session — screenshots/logs from manual verification passes, not source-controlled
# project docs. Keep scratch work in the agent's own scratchpad directory, not the repo, going
# forward.
# NOTE (2026-10-30): docs/delivery/evidence/ was almost added here too, but it turns out to hold a
# MIX of real committed PLACE-XXX-evidence-index.md tickets alongside ad-hoc per-session scratch
# subfolders with no distinguishing naming pattern between the two (e.g. the tracked
# `description-cas-db-2026-10-06/` looks exactly like an untracked `candidate-*-2026-10-07/`) — a
# blanket ignore here would have silently blocked future legitimate PLACE-XXX evidence from ever
# being `git add`-able. Deliberately NOT ignored; review new untracked subfolders there by hand
# before committing/deleting, don't bulk-delete without checking `git ls-files` first.
owner-captures/
scratch/

# apps/web/AGENTS.md is regenerated by `next dev` on every run (see the file's own header
# comment) — tracking it just produces permanent dirty-working-tree noise, not a real change.
apps/web/AGENTS.md
